You are regressing variables and correlating the same variables.

  depression_2002 ~ drug_2000 + health_2000 + depression_2000

And

  depression_2002 ~~ depression_2000

In the same model will always lead to non identification.

When this happens, look closely at the output you get and see if the model tries to estimate parameters you aren't expecting (such as a correlation between depression at 2 waves).

Jeremy

