Subject: Re: Partial scalar invariance in a measurement model with ordinal indicators
Message-ID: <zUDIR2GjhAI.ZTAIWeFFAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <zUDIR2GjhAI.8kOgXGzGAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
